{"parentUuid":"3a9d5d8b-91d7-42e2-b839-71e2867377af","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"105b53b8-833a-4902-bafe-8b0101ae9bdb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L1bjc7kHSYXYSnN6HaCpQD","type":"tool_result","content":"ok fetched\nCHANGELOG.md                      | 18 +++++++++++\n docs/releases/v1.3.0-READINESS.md | 63 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 81 insertions(+)\n# v1.3.0 readiness inventory\n\nMeasured against `origin/release/v1.3.0` tip **`56e644cf`** (2026-11-23). Version strings are still **1.2.2**; this is not an RC cut and not a tag. External qualification is pending. This is not a frontier-grade claim.\n\n## Merge queue\n\nEmpty against `release/v1.3.0` at inventory time. Required checks on tip: green (`linux-x86_64`, `test-matrix` 22/24).\n\n## Plan units (from `docs/v1.3.0/PLAN.md`)\n\n| Unit | Status on tip | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| PF-1 | Landed | `docs/PROTOCOL.md`, `docs/protocol/*.schema.json`, parity/conformance tests |\n| PF-2 | Landed | `cli/src/run_contract.ts`, `docs/protocol/RUN_RESULT_VERSIONS.json` |\n| PF-3 | Open | No UDS/multi-client transport beyond stdio |\n| PF-4 | Open | `cli/package.json` has no `exports` / `types` library entry |\n| AC-1 | Landed | ACP adapter + gate tests; PRs #740/#741 and follow-ups |\n| AC-2 | Landed | `docs/evidence/AC2_ACP_CONFORMANCE.md`; Zed + CodeCompanion fixtures |\n| VR-1 | Landed | `nexus verify` + hostile/fixture work (#732/#737) |\n| VR-2 | Landed | PR #756 |\n| VR-3 | Landed | Sandbox denial records (PR #745) |\n| GV-1 | Landed | Managed policy library + enforcement |\n| GV-2 | Landed | `nexus audit export` / `verify` |\n| GV-3 | Landed | `cli/src/core/hash_chain.ts` + flight replay |\n| GV-4 | Landed | `docs/TELEMETRY.md` + no-network / off / retention tests |\n| GV-5 | Landed | `approval.strict` refuses `--yes` / `--mode auto` with source tag; MCP/plugin allowlists in schema |\n| LS-1 / LS-2 | Landed | Lifecycle, bounds, position encodings, project roots |\n| CI speedup | Landed | Shard fan-out PRs #742–#748 |\n| HK-1 / HK-2 | Open | No `docs/HOOKS.md`, no `nexus plugins install` |\n| BG-1 / BG-2 | Open | No detached runner / schedule CLI |\n| PA-1 | Partial | Resource admission documented; `operation watch` / owner receipts still open (`docs/v1.3.0/PA1_RESOURCE_ADMISSION.md`) |\n| PA-2 | Open | No verified merge arbitration |\n| PA-3 / HK-3 / BG-3 | Stretch (may roll) | Per plan Phase D |\n| PA-4 | Partial / staged | Provider-neutral workflow slices landed; WP-P10-02 and remaining lifecycle still in flight under Codex claims |\n\n## Active Codex lanes (do not steal)\n\n- `codex/context-maturity-v130` — full `make test` on `cabe335e` finished **failed** (2026-11-23 ~21:50Z): CLI suite `cloud_providers.test.ts` — `operator cancellation mid-stream aborts promptly as 'aborted'` hung ~300s then failed `Date.now() - t0 < 2000`. Release tip CI remains green; treat as qualification blocker for that branch until re-run or abort-path fix.\n- `v1/p10-02-inference-submission-budget` — WP-P10-02 cumulative inference budget (live claim).\n\n## Release gates (G-1–G-7) — measured\n\n| Gate | Measured |\n|---|---|\n| G-1 | Tip CI green; local full-suite on tip not re-run in this inventory |\n| G-2 | Protocol schemas + AC-2 fixtures present; AC-1 experimental wording still appropriate until notes say otherwise |\n| G-3 | Hostile verify / managed-policy / ACP gate tests present; full hostile matrix not re-audited here |\n| G-4 | Open until BG-1/BG-2 land |\n| G-5 | Audit export/verify tests present (GV-2) |\n| G-6 | Protocol, telemetry, managed policy, ACP docs present; hooks/plugins/schedules docs absent |\n| G-7 | Framing: ledger closed for landed units above, **qualification pending** |\n\n## RC / stable cut (owner-gated)\n\nDo **not** tag from this inventory. When scope for RC is agreed:\n\n1. Version bump + `CHANGELOG` replace Unreleased (see `docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md`).\n2. Release notes under `docs/releases/v1.3.0-rc.N.md` with G-7 framing.\n3. Land via merge-commit PR to `main` / release branch; tag only on owner instruction after required checks and ancestor rules.\n\n## Deferred from a thin RC (candidate)\n\nIf the owner wants an early RC of the platform track that is already on tip: ship PF-1/2, AC-1/2, VR-1/2/3, GV-1–5, LS-*, CI shards; call HK/BG/PF-3/4/PA-2 and remaining PA-4 **not in this release**. Context-maturity and P10-02 either land first or stay out of the notes.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"71090799-f448-405b-996b-11c0329ce933","timestamp":"2026-11-23T22:02:44.264Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ok fetched\nCHANGELOG.md                      | 18 +++++++++++\n docs/releases/v1.3.0-READINESS.md | 63 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 81 insertions(+)\n# v1.3.0 readiness inventory\n\nMeasured against `origin/release/v1.3.0` tip **`56e644cf`** (2026-11-23). Version strings are still **1.2.2**; this is not an RC cut and not a tag. External qualification is pending. This is not a frontier-grade claim.\n\n## Merge queue\n\nEmpty against `release/v1.3.0` at inventory time. Required checks on tip: green (`linux-x86_64`, `test-matrix` 22/24).\n\n## Plan units (from `docs/v1.3.0/PLAN.md`)\n\n| Unit | Status on tip | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| PF-1 | Landed | `docs/PROTOCOL.md`, `docs/protocol/*.schema.json`, parity/conformance tests |\n| PF-2 | Landed | `cli/src/run_contract.ts`, `docs/protocol/RUN_RESULT_VERSIONS.json` |\n| PF-3 | Open | No UDS/multi-client transport beyond stdio |\n| PF-4 | Open | `cli/package.json` has no `exports` / `types` library entry |\n| AC-1 | Landed | ACP adapter + gate tests; PRs #740/#741 and follow-ups |\n| AC-2 | Landed | `docs/evidence/AC2_ACP_CONFORMANCE.md`; Zed + CodeCompanion fixtures |\n| VR-1 | Landed | `nexus verify` + hostile/fixture work (#732/#737) |\n| VR-2 | Landed | PR #756 |\n| VR-3 | Landed | Sandbox denial records (PR #745) |\n| GV-1 | Landed | Managed policy library + enforcement |\n| G