{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChLd67sy1HbACxdG68Bhu","mark_sent_by":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","listed":["REDACTED"]}]}
{"parentUuid":"5bdaed1a-094a-4528-8f86-b7b0aec44808","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLd67sy1HbACxdG68Bhu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The #758 review is in and posted on the PR as request changes. It is not in the merge queue.\n\n- **A process restart is not detected, only a host reboot.** The PR uses the kernel's boot id, which changes only when the machine reboots. A goal left running by a crash or a clean exit stays `RUNNING` after a restart on the same boot, with nothing driving it. That is the case the plan unit exists for. On hosts without `/proc`, such as macOS, nothing is ever paused.\n- **The new test doesn't test it.** It seeds the goal already paused, so all six tests still pass with the new logic removed.\n- **What holds:** a model saying \"done\" still cannot complete a goal, and nothing in the diff loosens an approval, budget or policy check. Resuming is explicit.\n\nThe author pushed one more commit during the review; it only adds token-usage reporting, so the findings apply to the current head as well.\n\nQueue state: #757 and #758 are both waiting on their author, the release branch is green at `56e644cf`, and nothing is mergeable right now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1932,"cache_read_input_tokens":467690,"output_tokens":343,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1932,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":343,"cache_read_input_tokens":467690,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1932},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"di