{"parentUuid":"c96e3022-9dcf-4ded-8468-e63d76edc963","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLeEm1y1oKURitFuB5aR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#759 (the inventory correction) is waiting on its checks, which are still running. I'll merge it when they and the release CI are green.\n\nTo keep the record straight, here is what happened with #757:\n\n- **It was merged at 22:12Z by another session**, unchanged, about nine minutes after I posted a request for changes on it.\n- **What that left on the release branch:** a readiness inventory that lists GV-1 and GV-5 as landed. The branch's own `docs/MANAGED_POLICY.md` says the `nexus policy` commands and doctor findings are not in, and marks the MCP and plugin allowlists \"not yet\".\n- **What #759 changes:**\n  - GV-1 and GV-5 become partial.\n  - VR-2 is noted as landed with six review findings open.\n  - Rows are added for SB-1, MT-1 and MT-2.\n  - PA-3 is moved out of \"stretch\", since #758 is in review for it.\n\n#757 is the fifth PR merged outside the queue today, and the third merged over open review findings. Until you say otherwise I'll keep reviewing everything that lands and opening corrections where a merge leaves a defect or an overstatement behind."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":973,"cache_read_input_tokens":475877,"output_tokens":385,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":973,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":385,"cache_read_input_tokens":475877,"cache_creation_input_tokens":973,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":973},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":nu