{"parentUuid":"a48bc6b3-4e49-47e7-bee8-2b002eaf326c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLi5T8tVNyurMK6ardVp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#760 (the inference-submission budget) is merged and the release branch is green at `51bf3db7`.\n\n- **How it got there:** the author fixed both blockers. I ran the previously failing tests at the final head myself (`protocol_parity`, `leak_guard`, the budget tests; all pass), and the required checks were green on the merge with the current release tip.\n- **Follow-ups left on the PR:** the docs should say which side calls are not counted against the budget, that a project `.env` can raise the ceiling, and that without durable state the counter is per turn.\n\nOne PR is open: #758 (PA-3), still at the head with changes requested and red CI.\n\nStill not done for v1.3.0, unchanged:\n\n- **Unbuilt:** PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2.\n- **Unfinished:** GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, and the six VR-2 follow-ups.\n- **Yours:** which units roll to v1.4, and the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the tag."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":509748,"output_tokens":370,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":435,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":370,"cache_read_input_tokens":509748,"cache_creation_input_tokens":435,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":435},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChLi5SyDjS4CQYzEiC5Du"