{"parentUuid":"3cce9d9d-d549-48ce-9423-6a4e514998d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLnrYSqo5D1EdNK6YfJi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#762 is merged and the release branch is green at `6b916195`. One PR is open: #758 (PA-3), still waiting on its author.\n\n**#762 (turn deadline enforced during in-flight work)**\n- Opened against `main`; I retargeted it to the release branch and merged the release branch into it.\n- I reviewed the 20-line source change myself and posted an accept with follow-ups.\n- CI then failed on the leak-guard ratchet, because the new test file didn't register the guard.\n- The author's later commits fixed that, and also covered two of my follow-ups: a guard against arming the timer for a non-finite deadline, and tests for cancellation during a tool call and for timer cleanup.\n- I ran the tests at the final head (all pass) and merged on green required checks.\n\n**A mistake of mine, corrected**\nI wrote on the PR and in the claims log that I had pushed a one-line fix, before reading the push result. The push had been rejected because the branch had moved, and the author had already made the same fix. I posted a correction in both places; nothing of mine landed on that branch beyond the merge of the release branch.\n\n**Merged by me after review since the quota pause:** #759, #760, #761, #762.\n\n**Still not done for v1.3.0**\n- Unbuilt: PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2.\n- Unfinished: GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, the six VR-2 follow-ups, and PA-3 (#758).\n- Yours: which units roll to v1.4, and the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the tag."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_read_input_tokens":542072,"output_tokens":550,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fe