{"parentUuid":"78df9eaf-2fd0-40f5-ab45-0d6edbb40785","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLrJ3XczREmdBwTNfV7J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#758 (PA-3) is merged and the release branch is green at `d03e6199`. No PRs are open.\n\n**PA-3 as merged, after three review rounds**\n- **Goals:** a goal left active by a dead process comes back paused with a reason. A goal whose owner is still alive is left alone, and paused, completed or cancelled goals are untouched. The tests fail when the goal-level check is removed.\n- **Regression fixed:** a freshly planned operation is no longer paused before it runs.\n- **Follow-ups on the PR, none blocking:**\n  - The same check on the operation path has no test of its own.\n  - The goal and operation layers disagree about a blocked goal whose owner has died.\n  - The doc doesn't state two limits: a reused process id reads as alive, and state from another host is never paused.\n\n**Merged by me after review since the quota pause:** #758, #759, #760, #761, #762. The real-server LSP suite and the real-project smoke both passed on the previous tip (`6b916195`); I haven't rerun them since #758.\n\n**What still stands between here and landing v1.3.0**\n- **Unbuilt:** PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2.\n- **Unfinished:** GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, the six VR-2 follow-ups.\n- **Not ready:** Codex's context-maturity branch still fails its own full local test run and has no PR.\n- **Yours:** which units roll to v1.4, then the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the release-candidate tag. The readiness inventory on the release branch proposes a thin release candidate from what has landed; if you want that, say so and I'll prepare the version bump, changelog and release notes as a PR for your approval."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_to