{"parentUuid":"fbca546e-b0be-43da-8f34-db05d305081d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMBvQ4rncXUuusTsKoS6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The review of #770 and my fixes for its findings are posted on the PR, and the updated branch is pushed. I'm waiting on its CI before merging; nothing has failed so far.\n\n- **What the review found, now fixed:**\n  - The kill could signal the worker's pid after the worker had exited, when that pid might belong to another process.\n  - Processes added by the last listing weren't signalled.\n  - The server's exit handler could stall for a long time if the process listing hung.\n- **What held up:** nothing is left stopped, the graceful cancel path still removes its scratch directories, and the reviewer's own loop gave 0 orphans in 120 runs.\n- **After the fixes:** the service tests pass 10 of 10, the MCP tests 7 of 7, and another 150 cancellations left 0 orphans.\n\nThe three follow-up fixes were made after the review, so they haven't had a second reader. They are small and each follows the reviewer's stated fix."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2338,"cache_read_input_tokens":660416,"output_tokens":309,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2338,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":309,"cache_read_input_tokens":660416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2338,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2338},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_m