{"parentUuid":"56031a90-d66e-4106-9a10-654fa9cb8eb6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMUNmYXWCkVxzyJ1P66S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016dGqCfFWorxMsYk8vUFAZs","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/mike/.claude/projects/-home-mike-nexus-code/memory/v130-owner-directive-build-and-release-2026-11-24.md","content":"---\nname: v130-owner-directive-build-and-release-2026-11-24\ndescription: Owner told this session to build the remaining v1.3.0 units itself and then run the merge to main and the release\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nOwner, 2026-11-24 ~08:50Z, verbatim: \"Required: completion of Unbuilt and Unfinished items as listed above. Once that has been satisfied, the merge to main and release process is yours to complete.\"\n\nThe list it refers to (from my message just before): **Unbuilt** PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1, HK-2, HK-3, PA-2. **Unfinished** GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, the six VR-2 follow-ups (posted on PR #756).\n\n**Why:** I had asked repeatedly which units roll to v1.4 and who builds them; the answer is none roll, and this session builds them. It supersedes the \"merge and CI only\" role of 2026-11-23 ([[merge-and-review-role-2026-11-23]]) for these units.\n\n**How to apply:** build each unit in its own worktree under a claim, with an independent review before merge, on `release/v1.3.0`. The go-ahead for the single merge to `main`, the RC tag and the release is conditional on those items being complete: it is not a go-ahead to tag earlier. Release mechanics still follow AGENTS.md and `docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md` (RC first, version-only stable commit, tags immutable). My interpretation: \"complete\" means each unit's plan acceptance is met and the gates G-1..G-7 can be evaluated; BG-3 stays deferred to v1.4 because the plan itself defers it. See [[v130-progress]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":346,"cache_read_input_tokens":749894,"output_tokens":2381,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1139},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":346,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2381,"cache_read_input_tokens":749894,"cache_creation_input_tokens":346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":346},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":5988,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016dGqCfFWorxMsYk8vUFAZs":{"file_path":"/home/mike/.claude/projects/-home-mike-nexus-code/memory/v130-owner-directive-build-and-release-2026-11-24.md","content":"---\nname: v130-owner-directive-build-and-release-2026-11-24\ndescription: Owner told this session to build the remaining v1.3.0 units itself and then run the merge to main and the release\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nOwner, 2026-11-24 ~08:50Z, verbatim: \"Required: completion of Unbuilt and Unfinished items as listed above. Once that has been satisfied, the merge to main and release process is yours to complete.\"\n\nThe list it refers to (from my message just before): **Unbuilt** PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1, HK-2, HK-3, PA-2. **Unfinished** GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, the six VR-2 follow-ups (posted on PR #756).\n\n**Why:** I had asked repeatedly which units roll to v1.4 and who builds them; the answer is none roll, and this session builds them. It supersedes the \"merge and CI only\" role of 2026-11-23 ([[merge-and-review-role-2026-11-23]]) for these units.\n\n**How to apply:** build each unit in its own worktree under a claim, with an independent review before merge, on `release/v1.3.0`. The go-a