{"parentUuid":"8cf4554b-3a84-42b0-a2b4-14f24499c3d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMVijQTmC7mR6p9io43S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Status at about 09:45Z:\n\n**Security fix in flight**\n- **#776** closes the one bypass the probe found in the audit-export check: a registered submodule's own git configuration wasn't seen, so its filter ran. The fix refuses any workspace that has a submodule. It also removes a defect in my earlier #772: the function returned early, which would have skipped any later condition.\n- All six related test files pass locally, and the new test fails for the right reason when the submodule check is disabled.\n- A short independent review is running. It also tries a nested repository that isn't registered as a submodule, which my fix does not obviously cover. I'll merge on a clean verdict and green checks, or fix what it finds first.\n\n**Build tracks, all still running**\n- Implementing: the six VR-2 follow-ups; GV-1 slices 3–4 with the GV-5 allowlists.\n- Planning: BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3; and PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, PA-2.\n\n**Also open:** #774, Codex's cumulative elapsed-time budget, which I haven't reviewed yet. I'll take it next in the queue.\n\nThe release branch is at `4ae25a10`, CI green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2315,"cache_read_input_tokens":786920,"output_tokens":405,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2315,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":405,"cache_read_input_tokens":786920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2315},"type":"message"}],"speed"