{"parentUuid":"9222a3e5-4b53-4c45-a38e-1e27ea767e1b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMWyQFohY6tK8uhMjVr4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The first build track is done and in review: the six VR-2 follow-ups are open as #777, with an independent review running.\n\n- **What #777 changes:**\n  - The verification base is pinned once per workspace instead of per session, with a bound on how many workspaces are remembered.\n  - The `_nexus/verify` result names the workspace and the pinned base (adapter schema v4; earlier versions untouched).\n  - Reading a receipt without an id returns turn receipts only, as before.\n  - The verify/prompt interlocks now have tests.\n  - A signalled adapter waits long enough for a running verification to clean up.\n- **Tested locally (Node 24):** ten test files pass, including the recorded Zed and CodeCompanion sessions still replaying. Removing each guard fails a test.\n- **One test-timing change to know about:** `acp_stdio.test.ts` waited 10 seconds for a real turn. Under the load of my parallel work two of its tests timed out, and one did so on unchanged sources too, so the wait is now 45 seconds. I asked the reviewer to confirm nothing else in that file was weakened.\n\nStill running: GV-1 slices 3–4 with the GV-5 allowlists, both planning tracks, and the review of #774 and #775. The release CI on the #776 merge is in progress."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2999,"cache_read_input_tokens":803881,"output_tokens":428,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2999,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":428,"cache_read_input_tokens":803881,"cache_cr